<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23650" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείελος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείλη</span> (q. v.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἦμαρ</span>
			<i>the evening part of</i> day, <i>eventide,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.606
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.86
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὥρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.417
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα</span>),
				<i>late evening,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσόκεν ἔλθῃ δ. ὀψὲ δύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.232
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				1.4.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτὶ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ δείελον</span> at <i>even,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.650
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leont.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1160
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείελον, τό,</span>
			<i>afternoon meal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				190
			</span></i> (perh. =
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1362
			</span></i> ii <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>). (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειελός</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.161
			</span></i>.)</div>
